title: "critique-defense-copilot"
abstract: >-
  線上被惡意質疑、人身攻擊、帶風向、截圖喊告恐嚇時的冷靜應對教練。
  A calm-response coach for handling online malicious criticism, personal
  attacks, manufactured outrage, and screenshot-and-threaten-to-sue
  intimidation. Helps users recognize manipulation playbooks, predict the
  next move, triage what to answer, brake before posting regrettable replies,
  and respond without escalating — defense-oriented, never producing attack
  content aimed at real targets.
